Destroy armor can be used (if cursed and when confused) to repair armor.
If you dip a unicorn horn into a potion, you get one of three
possibilities: fruit juice, water or no change. Paralysis is the only
dangerous one (other than booze) that doesn't change and it auto-id's.
The effect of booze can be cancelled by a unicorn horn. Booze makes you
confused. That's the best way to id potions and get potions of water.
You double dip the fruit juices into a fountain. *Never* drink a cursed
potion this way. If you get a reply of a tool, you've just found a
potion of polymorph. 


Those boots may be fumbling. but doubtful as it shows pretty quick or jumping or kicking
or water walking. See if a kick kills something, take off all but the boots, drop
everything and try walking into a pool of water. Jumping works up to three squares
and you can't jump at *all* without the ability (knights) or the boots.


